# per mutant in the start-log diff. M1's twin drive is live too and uncounted, as is its deciding drive: m_nocall.sh's
# only top-level line is the deleted call, so the copy runs a function definition and no simple command, and the
# counter's DEBUG trap never fires (0 start rows on both sides).
# The +11: arms S1-S2 and D1-D4 (BL-999, BL-1010), the same +11 measured on that unit alone (19 -> 30) before BL-984:
